  r1,导出并行阶段分组,"",ExecutionPlan.stages 非空,"VizGraphSnapshot MUST 包含每个 stage 的阶段信息,并允许 UI 将同级 stage 表达为可并行区域"
  r1,"composed-outputs-在依赖图中可见",运行请求配置了 output composition 且包含至少一个输出目标,生成 VizGraphSnapshot,nodes MUST 包含输出目标节点
  r2,baseline,"","TODO: describe the trigger","TODO: describe the expected result"
